  "result": "Perfect! All 130 tests pass \u2713\n\n**Payment tracking is complete:**\n\n1. **`src/payments.js`** \u2014 Two new functions:\n   - `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })`: Records a payment on issued/partially_paid invoices. Amount must be a positive integer in cents. Rejects overpayments and updates status to 'paid' (when fully paid) or 'partially_paid'.\n   - `balanceDue(invoice)`: Returns the amount still owed (total - sum of payments).\n\n2. **`src/errors.js`** \u2014 Added error codes:\n   - `NOT_ISSUED`: Payment attempted on draft or paid invoice\n   - `OVERPAYMENT`: Payment exceeds remaining balance\n\n3. **`test/payments.test.js`** \u2014 20 comprehensive tests covering:\n   - Payments on issued invoices\n   - Rejection of draft invoices\n   - Amount validation (negative, zero, non-integer)\n   - Overpayment prevention\n   - Status transitions (issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n   - Multiple payments accumulating\n   - Balance due calculations\n   - Immutability checks\n\nReady to commit when you approve the git operations.",
